cy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is correct, but I have a minor concern with it making the command line for each compiled file even longer than it already is. Windows in particular can be touchy with long commands (though mostly the linking ones, not individual .cpp files), and in general it just adds quite a bit of noise to verbose logs for something practically used only in this folder.\r\n\r\nIdeally we'd compile `servers/rendering/renderer_rd/spirv-reflect/*.cpp` in a cloned env, and only add those defines there. But it seems `spirv_reflect.h` is also included in `drivers/metal` so that wouldn't work.\r\n\r\nThe other option would be to lightly patch `spirv_reflect.h` so we don't need to pass this on the command line.","created_at":"2025-12-02T13:22:38Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T13:22:52Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111452#discussion_r2581165940","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111452","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2581165940"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111452#discussion_r2581165940"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111452"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2581165940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":16,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":17,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":13,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2581260608","pull_request_review_id":3530221461,"id":2581260608,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z2ulA","diff_hunk":"@@ -5,14 +5,17 @@ Import(\"env\")\n \n # Thirdpa